# #288 input replay: one session through a menu, a text field, a modal dialog, a scroll list
# and a controller. Coordinates are viewport pixels (640x360, UI scale 1.25); @key = centre.

# Pointer: hover, click, a press that wanders off, and empty space.
move @play
down @play
up @play
down @options
up @quit
down 600 340
up 600 340

# Keyboard: Tab and arrows, focus indication, Enter clicks; arrows do not wrap.
key TAB
key TAB
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
key TAB shift

# The text field: click, type (one rejected character), invalid commit, fix, commit, revert.
down @name
up @name
text Steve1
key ENTER
key BACKSPACE
key ENTER
text x
key ESCAPE
key ESCAPE

# Quit opens a modal: focus moves in, clicks outside are blocked, Escape closes and restores.
down @quit
up @quit
down @play
up @play
key TAB
key ESCAPE
key TAB

# A held key across focus loss; a stale repeat.
hold DOWN
focus-lost
release DOWN
repeat ENTER

# The scroll list: wheel over it, then a controller walking into it and confirming.
move @list
wheel @list 1
pad DPAD_RIGHT down
pad DPAD_RIGHT up
pad DPAD_DOWN down
tick 0.3
tick 0.2
tick 0.1
pad DPAD_DOWN up
pad A down
tick 1
pad A up
leave
screen-closed
